{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/1_EN.png?t=1749044163\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/character_choice.gif?t=1749044163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play up to 2 characters, each with their own set of runes and cards. Prepare yourself and dive into the world of Unbound Eternity. A turn-based combat game with deck-building features where you\u2019re not the hero BUT a MONSTER, invading the lands owned by a mysterious cult of &quot;the eye&quot; !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/2_EN.png?t=1749044163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/fight.gif?t=1749044163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight the army of the empress with your runes and cards, and face unpredictable events to grow stronger. Your goal? Survive and defeat the hero chosen by &quot;the eye&quot;. Break the cycle and claim your reign over the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/3_EN.png?t=1749044163\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/chose_your_path.gif?t=1749044163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget dull map navigation! Here, you <strong>build</strong> your own path forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick the battles you want\u00a0and collect their rewards: shop discounts, immortality (really?), permanent combat buffs, and more to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/4_EN.png?t=1749044163\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/manage_inventory.gif?t=1749044163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine tiles, gather artifacts, upgrade and craft your cards to <strong>BEAT THE GAME!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use runes to play your cards and create combos. Multiply your damage, poison your enemies, and much more!  Each rune represents an action during your turn, and as a monster, you naturally have several at your disposal! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/reward.gif?t=1749044163\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All the cards are in your hand, so are you up to it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/5_EN.png?t=1749044163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is still in <i>alpha</i> and offers a glimpse of the full game experience. More content, difficulty modes, Steam achievements, playable characters, and better balancing/economy are on the way. The demo is english only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can support development by leaving a review or joining our Discord community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the demo!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751830?t=1749044163","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/a1b71f0a616b99e877b4651a1ac5f52371444259/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749044163","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/082de0dad080ff42957ef3e152eced91e464af41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749044163","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/082de0dad080ff42957ef3e152eced91e464af41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749044163","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/1_EN.png?t=1749044163\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/character_choice.gif?t=1749044163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play up to 2 characters, each with their own set of runes and cards. Prepare yourself and dive into the world of Unbound Eternity. A turn-based combat game with deck-building features where you\u2019re not the hero BUT a MONSTER, invading the lands owned by a mysterious cult of &quot;the eye&quot; !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/2_EN.png?t=1749044163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/fight.gif?t=1749044163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight the army of the empress with your runes and cards, and face unpredictable events to grow stronger. Your goal? Survive and defeat the hero chosen by &quot;the eye&quot;. Break the cycle and claim your reign over the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/3_EN.png?t=1749044163\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/chose_your_path.gif?t=1749044163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget dull map navigation! Here, you <strong>build</strong> your own path forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick the battles you want\u00a0and collect their rewards: shop discounts, immortality (really?), permanent combat buffs, and more to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/4_EN.png?t=1749044163\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/manage_inventory.gif?t=1749044163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine tiles, gather artifacts, upgrade and craft your cards to <strong>BEAT THE GAME!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use runes to play your cards and create combos. Multiply your damage, poison your enemies, and much more!  Each rune represents an action during your turn, and as a monster, you naturally have several at your disposal! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/reward.gif?t=1749044163\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All the cards are in your hand, so are you up to it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/extras/5_EN.png?t=1749044163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is still in <i>alpha</i> and offers a glimpse of the full game experience. More content, difficulty modes, Steam achievements, playable characters, and better balancing/economy are on the way. The demo is english only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can support development by leaving a review or joining our Discord community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the demo!</p>","developers":["Yunicorn Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3274090","name":"Unbound Eternity"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751830/6d0958163d5396558f498d03e461c482e8f093ca/header.jpg?t=1749044163","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 5500, Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M2 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257146483,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146483/movie480.mp4?t=1748524740","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146483/movie_max.mp4?t=1748524740"},"name":"Trailer_Unbound_Eternity","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146483/7199182f00766c17658113d41713b7dbd3ba965a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748524740","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146483/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748524740","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146483/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748524740"}}],"name":"Unbound Eternity Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_req